' Silent launcher for vm-watchdog.ps1 - runs powershell.exe fully hidden
' (0 = SW_HIDE), so the scheduled task doesn't flash a console window
' every minute. wscript.exe itself also runs with no window. Calling
' powershell.exe directly from the scheduled task's action instead of
' through this wrapper is the easy mistake to make here - it works, but
' flashes a visible console window on every run.
Set objShell = CreateObject("WScript.Shell")
objShell.Run "powershell.exe -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File ""<path-to-filled-in-vm-watchdog.ps1>""", 0, True
